---
/**
 * Honesty requirements (CLAUDE.md section 15).
 *
 * This must appear on the console and the landing page. Never weaken the
 * wording. A longer version lives on /about.
 */
---

<footer class="border-t border-hairline bg-slate/60 px-6 py-5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-mist">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl space-y-1.5">
    <p>
      <strong class="font-medium text-frost">Simulation.</strong> Streets and hospital
      locations are real, from OpenStreetMap. Bed counts, ambulances, casualties and
      supplies are simulated.
    </p>
    <p>Decision support for dispatchers. Not a medical device and not a diagnosis.</p>
    <p>Not connected to BMC, the 108 service or any hospital system.</p>
    <p>
      Map data &copy; OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the
      <a
        class="text-ice-500 underline decoration-hairline underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-ice-500"
        href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright"
        rel="noreferrer noopener"
        target="_blank">Open Database Licence</a
      >.
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
